      "category": "Text",
      "text": "(3) Any employee may present his own grievance through the first three steps of the grievance procedure either personally or through an appropriate representative of an organization of which he is a member, provided, that where an employee organization has been certified as the exclusive bargaining agent for the employee unit, a grievance may be presented and processed either by such certified employee organization or by the individual employee, but not through any other employee organization.",
